# BioSense AI

## Virtual Electronic Nose for AI-Assisted Cancer Risk Pattern Screening

BioSense AI is an experimental research prototype that simulates a software-based electronic nose using publicly documented breath, VOC or electronic-nose sensor research data.

The platform combines full-stack web development, machine learning and explainable AI to investigate model-associated patterns in research datasets.

> **Medical Research Disclaimer:** BioSense AI is an experimental research prototype and is not a medical diagnostic device. Its results must not be used to diagnose, treat or rule out cancer. Medical decisions should be made only by qualified healthcare professionals.

---

## Project Status

🚧 Currently under development.

The project is being developed incrementally as a full-stack academic research project.

